{% if spe_frontend == 'openwebui' %}

## Pentest frontend (OpenWebUI)

OpenWebUI runs on the VM bound to `127.0.0.1:{{ spe_webui_local_port }}`, with an
`open-terminal` tool server that reaches this instance's own WES/DRS/TRS. The LLM
backend is `{{ spe_llm_base_url }}`. The agent system prompt is attached to the
model, so every chat gets it. Open a tunnel, then browse to
`http://localhost:{{ spe_webui_local_port }}` and log in with the admin account below:

{% if spe_ssh_prefix %}
```
{{ spe_ssh_prefix }} -N -L {{ spe_webui_local_port }}:127.0.0.1:{{ spe_webui_local_port }}
```
{% else %}
No tunnel is needed: this instance runs on the controller.
{% endif %}

| Admin login | Value |
|---|---|
| URL | `http://localhost:{{ spe_webui_local_port }}` |
| User | `{{ spe_webui_admin_email }}` |
| Password | `{{ spe_webui_admin_password }}` |
{% endif %}
{% if spe_frontend == 'agui' %}

## Agent frontend (AG-UI)

Three containers in compose project `spe-frontend`: the chat UI on
`127.0.0.1:{{ spe_agui_ui_port }}`, the agent (AG-UI endpoint `POST /agent`, model
`{{ spe_agent_model_provider }}:{{ spe_agent_model }}`) on `127.0.0.1:{{ spe_agui_agent_port }}`,
and the open-terminal sandbox, which publishes nothing. Only the agent holds the LLM key.

{% if spe_ssh_prefix %}
```
{{ spe_ssh_prefix }} -N -L {{ spe_agui_ui_port }}:127.0.0.1:{{ spe_agui_ui_port }} -L {{ spe_agui_agent_port }}:127.0.0.1:{{ spe_agui_agent_port }}
```

Then browse to `http://localhost:{{ spe_agui_ui_port }}`.
{% else %}
No tunnel is needed: this instance runs on the controller. Browse to `http://localhost:{{ spe_agui_ui_port }}`.
{% endif %}
The agent requires `Authorization: Bearer <key>`; the key is in `agent_api_key` in this
directory (mode 0600), never in this summary. promptfoo against the agent:
`SPE_AGENT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:{{ spe_agui_agent_port }}/agent SPE_AGENT_API_KEY_FILE={{ spe_output_dir }}/agent_api_key`,
then see `platform/promptfoo-evals/README.md`. Run log on the VM: `docker compose -p spe-frontend exec agent cat /var/lib/spe-agent/runs.jsonl`
(player input and canaries: keep it private).
{% endif %}

